**Behaviour** (`src/data/reminders.ts`):
- **Single trigger time. No recurrence, no snooze, no end time, no location/notes, no import.**
- Scheduler: `startReminderScheduler()` runs once, polls **every 60 seconds** with `setInterval`, queries `db.reminders` where `status = "pending"` and `triggerAt <= now`, calls `showReminderNotification(r)`, then sets `status: "fired"`. It queries the **currently open** database only.
